    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"This bibliography was compiled primarily from the Mineral Resources Data System (MRDS),  a U.S. Geological Survey generated and maintained database, and from GEOREF a bibliographic database compiled and maintained by American Geological Institute  (AGI)  from the Index of Geology, which they have always published. Many references of southeastern geology and mineral deposits papers were also compiled from the Raleigh mineral deposits preassessment, Bell (unpublished Haile manuscript) and the Greenville CUSMAP bulletin. This compilation was undertaken as a companion for the Southeast Mineral Resource Assessment.\"\r\n\r\nNOTE: This file can be opened with a text editor.",
